1251
00:55:06,640 --> 00:55:07,720
Three, two, one. Lights out.

1252
00:55:08,780 --> 00:55:09,560
(Night vision mode)

1253
00:55:09,560 --> 00:55:11,400
(Successful attack)
Eliminated. Bai Jingting's out!

1254
00:55:13,380 --> 00:55:14,860
(Moving with the lights on
means returning to the start)

1255
00:55:14,880 --> 00:55:16,120
Anyu, you moved.

1256
00:55:16,120 --> 00:55:17,440
Back to the start.

1257
00:55:17,440 --> 00:55:19,240
Bai, please head
to the elimination zone.

1258
