Hu's already used his banana peel.

1259
00:55:21,880 --> 00:55:22,640
It's no longer valid.

1260
00:55:22,980 --> 00:55:23,740
(Back to the start)

1261
00:55:23,760 --> 00:55:24,680
From this position,

1262
