That'll teach you to show off.

1264
00:55:29,000 --> 00:55:31,960
More bananas
will drop randomly in the dark.

1265
00:55:32,100 --> 00:55:33,580
(Lights out)

1266
00:55:34,660 --> 00:55:35,660
