1269
00:55:43,100 --> 00:55:44,940
(Night vision mode)

1270
00:55:50,540 --> 00:55:51,980
(Ah)

1271
00:55:51,980 --> 00:55:53,500
(Sweet-talking)
Hey, Jingyu.

1272
00:55:55,460 --> 00:55:56,980
(Sweet-talking)
Hey, Jingyu.

1273
00:55:57,240 --> 00:55:58,520
Jingyu, he's going for a chokehold.

1274
00:55:58,940 --> 00:55:59,580
(Sweet-talking)
Hey, Jingyu.

1275
00:55:59,580 --> 00:56:00,180
(Desperately trying to win him over)

1276
00:56:00,180 --> 00:56:01,100
(Sweet-talking)
It's me.

1277
00:56:01,260 --> 00:56:02,560
(Lights out)

1278
00:56:02,560 --> 00:56:03,480
Where are you?

1279
00:56:04,280 --> 00:56:05,160
Where are you?

1280
00:56:08,600 --> 00:56:10,000
Where's the banana?

1281
00:56:11,520 --> 00:56:13,320
Chengcheng, don't you have the banana?

1282
00:56:14,200 --> 00:56:15,080
I don't have it.

1283
00:56:15,080 --> 00:56:15,580
(Mr. Huang's got it)

1284
00:56:15,800 --> 00:56:16,640
Then who has it?

1285
00:56:17,780 --> 00:56:19,500
(Huang Jingyu)

1286
00:56:19,540 --> 00:56:20,920
(Night vision mode)

1287
00:56:20,920 --> 00:56:21,800
(Successful attack)
Wang Anyu's out.

1288
00:56:22,960 --> 00:56:24,160
Practice round over.

1289
00:56:24,160 --> 00:56:25,480
That's basically how it works.

1290
00:56:25,480 --> 00:56:26,400
Everyone got it?

1291
00:56:28,460 --> 00:56:30,460
