1295
00:56:45,800 --> 00:56:46,720
Let's team up.

1296
00:56:46,720 --> 00:56:47,360
I won't attack you.

1297
00:56:47,800 --> 00:56:48,560
Really?

1298
00:56:48,560 --> 00:56:49,080
Really.

1299
00:56:49,680 --> 00:56:50,960
(YiXian Ahead successfully team up)
Let's give it our all.

1300
00:56:50,960 --> 00:56:51,480
Okay.

1301
00:56:51,480 --> 00:56:51,840
