about to run a marathon.

1304
00:57:04,500 --> 00:57:06,060
(Magnifier, banana)

1305
00:57:06,220 --> 00:57:07,140
(Lights out)

1306
00:57:07,180 --> 00:57:07,960
(Night vision mode)

1307
00:57:07,960 --> 00:57:09,040
Already?

1308
00:57:12,860 --> 00:57:13,660
(Moving with the lights on
means returning to the start)

1309
00:57:13,680 --> 00:57:15,680
Jingyu, Chengcheng, go back.

1310
00:57:19,120 --> 00:57:20,240
