1311
00:57:20,240 --> 00:57:21,240
Was I supposed to not land?

1312
00:57:22,580 --> 00:57:23,860
(Back to the start)

1313
00:57:27,440 --> 00:57:28,080
Team up?

1314
00:57:28,680 --> 00:57:29,160
Wanna team up?

1315
00:57:29,160 --> 00:57:31,800
(Banana)
Isn't it a little late for that?

1316
00:57:31,800 --> 00:57:32,240
