1317
00:57:32,240 --> 00:57:32,770
Lin Yi.

1318
00:57:32,770 --> 00:57:34,360
Lin.

1319
00:57:34,360 --> 00:57:35,760
Ignore him. Eat it yourself!

1320
00:57:35,760 --> 00:57:36,600
Eat it!

1321
00:57:39,480 --> 00:57:40,680
Lin Yi, I'll hold him down.

1322
00:57:40,680 --> 00:57:41,520
Hurry up and eat.

1323
00:57:41,520 --> 00:57:41,960
Okay.

1324
00:57:43,860 --> 00:57:45,100
(Watching closely)

1325
00:57:47,980 --> 00:57:48,700
(Lights out)

1326
00:57:48,740 --> 00:57:51,980
(Night vision mode:
Bai sprints at full speed)

1327
00:57:52,380 --> 00:57:54,060
(Teng crawls at a snail's pace)

1328
00:57:55,820 --> 00:57:58,140
(Hu Xianxu, Wang Anyu, Lin Yi)

1329
00:57:58,180 --> 00:57:59,020
(Hu Xianxu, Wang Anyu)

1330
00:57:59,020 --> 00:58:00,620
(Narrowly escapes capture)

1331
00:58:05,620 --> 00:58:06,900
(Banana, Lin Yi)

1332
00:58:06,900 --> 00:58:07,580
(Hello)

1333
00:58:07,580 --> 00:58:08,980
