1336
00:58:15,780 --> 00:58:18,140
(A chill down his spine)

1337
00:58:18,580 --> 00:58:20,020
(Leave it to me)

1338
00:58:20,780 --> 00:58:21,260
(Lights out)

1339
00:58:21,300 --> 00:58:25,260
(Night vision mode)

1340
00:58:25,260 --> 00:58:26,940
