the Taobao Magic Magnifier)

1341
00:58:28,780 --> 00:58:30,440
(Bananas: Lin Yi, Bai Jingting.
Magnifier: Wang Churan)

1342
00:58:30,440 --> 00:58:32,080
Wang Anyu, back to the start.

1343
00:58:33,840 --> 00:58:34,720
I can't protect you anymore.

1344
00:58:35,240 --> 00:58:35,760
You got this!

1345
00:58:35,780 --> 00:58:37,260
(Go, Dumber)

1346
00:58:44,060 --> 00:58:46,900
(Lights out)

1347
00:58:50,780 --> 00:58:53,780
(Banana completely crushed)

1348
00:58:53,800 --> 00:58:55,360
We squashed the banana.

1349
00:58:55,360 --> 00:58:57,720
(Bananas: Lin Yi, Bai Jingting.
Magnifier: Wang Churan)

1350
00:58:57,720 --> 00:58:59,520
So the bullet is destroyed.

1351
00:58:59,900 --> 00:59:00,680
(Banana: Lin Yi.
Magnifier: Wang Churan)

1352
00:59:00,680 --> 00:59:01,700
(Banana invalidated)
It's fine. Keep going.

1353
00:59:01,920 --> 00:59:03,680
