1355
00:59:05,980 --> 00:59:07,820
(Making himself a weapon)

1356
00:59:08,940 --> 00:59:09,980
(Night vision mode)

1357
00:59:09,980 --> 00:59:11,260
(Tracking sounds to find targets)

1358
00:59:14,740 --> 00:59:16,460
(Eating a banana, holding a banana)

1359
00:59:16,660 --> 00:59:18,180
(YiXian Ahead and bananas
are bringing good luck)

1360
00:59:21,200 --> 00:59:22,080
I've finished mine.

1361
00:59:22,780 --> 00:59:27,180
(Banana peel: Lin Yi.
Magnifier: Wang Churan)

1362
00:59:27,180 --> 00:59:29,500
(Banana: Hu Xianxu)

1363
00:59:29,500 --> 00:59:31,580
(Yi takes the lead
and grabs all the supplies)

1364
00:59:37,800 --> 00:59:38,320
All set?

1365
00:59:39,360 --> 00:59:41,520
Wait, Mr. Huang.

1366
00:59:42,040 --> 00:59:42,920
