1369
00:59:54,760 --> 00:59:56,480
Protect me, okay?

1370
00:59:56,480 --> 00:59:58,080
I think Mr. Huang's gonna get me.

1371
00:59:58,680 --> 00:59:59,560
Then I'll get him.

1372
01:00:04,780 --> 01:00:06,140
