1377
01:00:17,320 --> 01:00:18,360
Why'd he go back?

1378
01:00:18,360 --> 01:00:19,460
(Free to move
after returning to the start)

1379
01:00:21,120 --> 01:00:21,820
Go back.

1380
01:00:21,860 --> 01:00:24,100
(Watching the action from the corner)

1381
01:00:26,720 --> 01:00:27,560
Where's Xu?

1382
01:00:27,560 --> 01:00:28,560
I'm behind you!

1383
01:00:28,560 --> 01:00:31,220
(Banana peels: Lin Yi, Hu Xianxu.
Magnifier: Wang Churan)

1384
01:00:36,820 --> 01:00:37,420
(Night vision mode)

1385
01:00:37,440 --> 01:00:39,060
(Lin Yi, Hu Xianxu)
Let's take out Huang Jingyu first.

1386
01:00:39,620 --> 01:00:42,780
(Priority target)

1387
01:00:42,860 --> 01:00:44,940
(Priority target: Lin Yi, Hu Xianxu)

1388
01:00:44,940 --> 01:00:46,580
