1665
01:13:31,840 --> 01:13:33,360
But I found my guy as well.

1666
01:13:33,360 --> 01:13:33,960
Chengcheng's double.

1667
01:13:34,320 --> 01:13:36,040
Our hairstyles are pretty
similar anyway.

1668
01:13:36,680 --> 01:13:38,360
We've both got curly hair.

1669
01:13:38,360 --> 01:13:40,200
You two should coordinate your pants

1670
01:13:40,200 --> 01:13:41,120
every morning.

1671
01:13:46,960 --> 01:13:48,480
Imagine if we'd had a magnifying glass.

1672
01:13:48,480 --> 01:13:49,680
Things might've turned out differently.

1673
01:13:49,680 --> 01:13:50,440
How about another round?

1674
01:13:50,440 --> 01:13:51,120
Lights off!

1675
01:13:51,120 --> 01:13:51,600
Let's go.

1676
01:13:51,600 --> 01:13:52,280
(Lights out)

1677
01:13:52,280 --> 01:13:53,360
I found something good.

1678
01:13:53,840 --> 01:13:55,120
What? Someone's touching me as well.

1679
01:13:55,120 --> 01:13:55,800
Turn on the lights.

1680
01:13:57,440 --> 01:13:58,680
Tmall Tech Gift Box.

1681
01:13:58,680 --> 01:13:59,680
Noise-canceling Bluetooth earbuds.

1682
01:13:59,680 --> 01:14:00,560
A smartwatch.

1683
01:14:00,560 --> 01:14:02,080
Aren't these travel essentials?

1684
01:14:02,080 --> 01:14:03,360
I've wanted these for ages.

1685
01:14:03,360 --> 01:14:04,600
Tmall's 11.11 Global Shopping Festival
is finally here.

1686
01:14:04,600 --> 01:14:05,880
I'm adding them all to my cart tonight.

1687
01:14:05,880 --> 01:14:06,600
Head over to Taobao

1688
01:14:06,600 --> 01:14:07,720
and search Natural High.

1689
01:14:07,720 --> 01:14:09,160
You might win

1690
01:14:09,160 --> 01:14:10,720
the same tech goodies I've got.

1691
01:14:10,720 --> 01:14:11,440
Share it with your friends

1692
01:14:11,440 --> 01:14:12,920
to unlock even more perks.

1693
01:14:12,920 --> 01:14:14,800
You could also win a handwritten

1694
01:14:14,800 --> 01:14:16,960
Songpan postcard,
or an 888-yuan travel fund!

1695
01:14:16,960 --> 01:14:18,720
After the giveaway, reserve your spot

1696
01:14:18,720 --> 01:14:19,760
for the Natural High team's

1697
01:14:19,760 --> 01:14:21,120
Tmall 11.11 Global Shopping Festival livestream.

1698
01:14:21,120 --> 01:14:22,720
Just search Natural High again.

1699
01:14:22,720 --> 01:14:24,640
Exclusive content awaits.

1700
01:14:24,640 --> 01:14:25,830
(Lights out)
Check it out now!

1701
01:14:27,160 --> 01:14:27,680
Great!

1702
01:14:31,920 --> 01:14:32,720
Good night!

1703
01:14:32,720 --> 01:14:33,240
Okay.

1704
01:15:18,660 --> 01:15:20,540
(Next episode)
Remote Word Guessing (Challenge).

1705
01:15:20,560 --> 01:15:21,280
You tell me.

1706
01:15:23,480 --> 01:15:24,320
You.

1707
01:15:24,760 --> 01:15:26,000
Veteran actor.

1708
01:15:26,000 --> 01:15:27,180
(Acting masterclass)
One move,

1709
01:15:27,200 --> 01:15:28,440
and you know his job.

1710
01:15:28,440 --> 01:15:29,960
You can tell what he does.

1711
01:15:29,960 --> 01:15:30,520
Bai.

1712
01:15:31,160 --> 01:15:32,440
After all those palace intrigues,

1713
01:15:32,440 --> 01:15:34,280
you're the first to play a eunuch.

1714
01:15:34,280 --> 01:15:36,080
A Beijing eunuch, no less!

1715
01:15:38,760 --> 01:15:39,720
That year,

1716
01:15:40,160 --> 01:15:41,000
when you were five,

1717
01:15:41,440 --> 01:15:42,240
you entered the palace...

1718
01:15:42,240 --> 01:15:43,640
Still a eunuch?

1719
01:15:43,640 --> 01:15:45,040
Your Highness, there's a fire.

1720
01:15:46,480 --> 01:15:47,280
Why the panic?

1721
01:15:47,280 --> 01:15:48,560
There's a fire.

1722
01:15:48,560 --> 01:15:49,520
Why's everyone a eunuch?

1723
01:15:49,520 --> 01:15:50,800
Are you all hooked on the role?

1724
01:15:50,800 --> 01:15:51,600
What's with everyone?

1725
01:15:52,700 --> 01:15:53,420
Little Artist (Challenge).

1726
01:15:53,520 --> 01:15:54,880
I've drawn a...

1727
01:15:54,880 --> 01:15:56,040
a hot pot.

1728
01:15:56,040 --> 01:15:56,880
(Hot pot)
With steam rising from it.

1729
01:15:56,880 --> 01:15:57,600
What's this?

1730
01:15:57,600 --> 01:15:58,520
That's a dragon dance.

1731
01:15:58,760 --> 01:16:00,400
(Dragon and Lion Dance)
I couldn't draw the lion dance.

1732
01:16:00,400 --> 01:16:01,920
Dragon and lion dances on the grassland?

1733
01:16:02,200 --> 01:16:04,000
Those are usually for grand openings.

1734
01:16:04,000 --> 01:16:05,880
Bro, you're getting out of hand.

1735
01:16:05,880 --> 01:16:06,800
Starting with that hot pot,

1736
01:16:06,800 --> 01:16:08,320
I just couldn't take it anymore.

1737
01:16:08,600 --> 01:16:09,760
I'm starting to doubt Jingyu.

1738
01:16:11,040 --> 01:16:12,000
No dragon dances on the grassland?

1739
01:16:12,320 --> 01:16:13,720
You could've just drawn some grass.

1740
01:16:13,840 --> 01:16:14,560
That's supposed to be grass?

1741
01:16:14,560 --> 01:16:15,360
It is grass!

1742
01:16:15,360 --> 01:16:16,120
Mine's a dragon dance.

1743
01:16:16,120 --> 01:16:16,900
(Dragon and Lion Dance)
And this is the lion dance.

1744
01:16:16,900 --> 01:16:18,680
Jingyu's always acting all tough.

1745
01:16:18,920 --> 01:16:19,920
(Determined to prove it)
One second is enough.

1746
01:16:20,200 --> 01:16:20,680
Guess!

1747
01:16:21,880 --> 01:16:22,400
One second!

1748
01:16:25,440 --> 01:16:27,640
I'll smear you all over!

1749
01:16:31,880 --> 01:16:32,600
Play the music!

1750
01:16:36,040 --> 01:16:36,560
Necklace.

1751
01:16:42,900 --> 01:16:45,340
(Enough talk, let's go)

1752
01:16:45,360 --> 01:16:45,720
Churan.

1753
01:16:45,720 --> 01:16:47,400
(Singing Without Blinking)
I can't sing "A Carefree Life".

1754
01:16:47,400 --> 01:16:49,200
(Bonus episode preview)
Do you even need

1755
01:16:49,200 --> 01:16:49,720
to know the song?

1756
01:16:49,720 --> 01:16:51,240
Your face, Teng's voice. Let's go.

1757
01:16:51,240 --> 01:16:52,560
(Teng to the rescue)
Just make sure you lip-sync.

1758
01:16:53,120 --> 01:16:54,880
♪The world keeps turning♪

1759
01:16:54,880 --> 01:16:56,760
(Who's even competing?)
♪Love runs deep♪

1760
01:16:56,940 --> 01:16:57,780
(Blinks)

1761
01:16:57,860 --> 01:16:58,940
(Come on, our king!)

1762
01:16:58,980 --> 01:17:00,300
(The team's last hope)

1763
01:17:00,780 --> 01:17:01,380
(You again)

1764
01:17:01,680 --> 01:17:02,540
Here he comes again.

1765
01:17:02,540 --> 01:17:02,820
(Get him)

1766
01:17:03,840 --> 01:17:06,360
♪Live it up♪

1767
01:17:06,420 --> 01:17:07,500
(Who's the ultimate staring champion)

1768
01:17:07,550 --> 01:17:08,860
(Looks right)
Eating bananas in the dark.

1769
01:17:08,860 --> 01:17:09,540
(Looks left)

1770
01:17:09,800 --> 01:17:10,520
Same old trick.

1771
01:17:10,520 --> 01:17:12,000
Let's reclaim our glory.

1772
01:17:12,000 --> 01:17:12,500
(Teaming up again)

1773
01:17:12,960 --> 01:17:13,640
Game starts.

1774
01:17:13,780 --> 01:17:14,540
(Lights out)

1775
01:17:14,540 --> 01:17:16,320
(Night vision mode)

1776
01:17:16,320 --> 01:17:16,880
Who is it?

1777
01:17:17,640 --> 01:17:18,880
Who's choking me?

1778
01:17:19,540 --> 01:17:20,260
(Ready for mischief)

1779
01:17:20,480 --> 01:17:21,760
(Seeking an alliance)
Anyu, let's team up.

1780
01:17:21,760 --> 01:17:23,180
Now you want an alliance?

1781
01:17:23,180 --> 01:17:25,780
(Night vision mode)

1782
01:17:25,780 --> 01:17:26,300
(Holding his leg down)

1783
01:17:27,180 --> 01:17:27,740
(Choking Mr. Huang)

1784
01:17:28,540 --> 01:17:29,300
(Rushing for the banana)

1785
01:17:29,860 --> 01:17:30,620
(Blocked by Lin)

1786
01:17:31,600 --> 01:17:32,600
Who's on top of me?

1787
01:17:32,600 --> 01:17:33,480
It's Bing.

1788
01:17:33,480 --> 01:17:35,080
(Crushed by Bing)
Who knew you'd be so fast?

1789
01:17:35,280 --> 01:17:35,880
Bro.

1790
01:17:35,880 --> 01:17:37,400
(Let's talk)
Aren't we allies?

1791
01:17:37,400 --> 01:17:38,920
Hu.

1792
01:17:38,920 --> 01:17:40,120
Are you trying to crush me?

1793
01:17:40,120 --> 01:17:40,580
(One hand is enough?)

1794
01:17:40,680 --> 01:17:42,880
There's nothing left to say.

1795
01:17:42,880 --> 01:17:43,960
(Night vision mode)
We may be allies,

1796
01:17:43,960 --> 01:17:44,920
but now...

1797
01:17:44,920 --> 01:17:45,480
(Alliance over)
I have no choice.

1798
01:17:46,000 --> 01:17:47,000
The whole point of this game

1799
01:17:47,000 --> 01:17:47,880
has changed now.

1800
01:17:48,040 --> 01:17:49,840
Jingyu takes out both old guys.

1801
01:17:49,900 --> 01:17:51,260
(Banana Battle in the Dark Challenge
coming up)

1802
01:17:51,260 --> 01:18:12,500
(Natural High S4 Viewing Calendar)
